    "title": "MC Works Explosion 807 CTR Standard Model",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The MC WORKS Explosion series incorporates a medium elastic multi-ply structure enable a rod which is light, responsive and has a powerful backbone. Ideal for casting stickbaits and diving pencils, this series is designed for kingfish and tuna anglers. </span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>With a higher PE rating and wide casting range, the 807CTR is the perfect model for anglers seeking a powerful rod to handle monstrous kingfish and GT’s. The blank enables a comfortable yet powerful fight with an ease of manoeuvrability. The rod will swim lures accurately in addition to superior casting and control.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong><span>Length</span></strong><span>: 8'0&quot;</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong><span>Line</span></strong><span>: PE #6-10</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong><span>Cast:</span></strong><span> 80-150g</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong><span>Drag max:</span></strong><span> 18 kg</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Guide: Titanium Hybrid PMNSG + KWSG guide</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Handmade in Japan</span></p>",
